<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A1" title="In VARCO-VISION-2.0 Technical Report" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A </span>Korean Benchmarks under English Instructions</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In VARCO-VISION-2.0 Technical Report" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Explicit Reasoning Instructions</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
